<title>USA: BFS Bankorp shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>BFS Bankorp shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFS Bankorp Inc said on Wednesday that a majority of its shareholders approved Dime Bancorp Inc's acquisition of the company.</p>
<p>The two companies entered an agreement in December for Dime to acquire the company for $92 million, or $52 a share, the company had said.</p>
